  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models (config_016) outperform RNA-only models (config_001/004), but uncertainty remains about whether RNA encoder choice (scvi_n200 vs pca_n2000) or image data contributes more. This experiment tests a multimodal model with scvi_n200 RNA encoder (a better RNA-only performer) to isolate the impact of RNA encoder choice in multimodal settings. It directly compares against config_016 (pca_n2000) with identical image encoder, fusion, and aggregation, answering whether RNA encoder quality drives multimodal performance."
